### Alle Trades abrufen
GET http://localhost:8081/api/trades

### Neuen Trade anlegen
POST http://localhost:8081/api/trades
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currencyPair": "EURUSD",
  "entryPrice": 1.0850,
  "stopLoss": 1.0800,
  "takeProfit": 1.0950,
  "initialRR": 2.0,
  "direction": "LONG"
}

### Trade schließen (z. B. Trade mit ID 1)
PATCH http://localhost:8081/api/trades/1/close?exitPrice=1.0950